色值数据（references/source.json 与 references/colors.json 中的 hex / RGB / CMYK
及中文色名）来自 https://zhongguose.com/ ，版权归原作者所有。本项目仅作整理与
计算加工，未修改任何 hex 值。详见 ATTRIBUTION.md。

Color values (hex / RGB / CMYK and Chinese color names in references/source.json
and references/colors.json) originate from https://zhongguose.com/ and remain
the property of their original author. This project only reorganizes and adds
computed attributes; no hex value was altered. See ATTRIBUTION.md.
